The fix is to close the  channel instead
of sending a message over it.
Since closing a channel is not a blocking operation,
the  goroutine is then able to release
the lock.
In turn, this unblocks the  goroutine,
which may now terminate by picking unblocked
 case branch in the  statement
on the next loop iteration.
